source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A killed opener settles nothing about the rest of the line, so Jira still bolds the later pair; jiro keeps the first three asterisks as text and reads the bold effect.
-- input.jira --
*a*b* *c*
-- rendered.html --
<p>*a*b* <b>c</b></p>
-- want.md --
\*a\*b\* **c**
-- warnings.json --
[]
